        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ferrite, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ferrite, at plant
Data about a MnZn ferrite (type (Mn,Zn)O.F2O3), based on general information from literature as well as estimations based on further processes of the database.;
UUID: bc643030-bb51-3ff4-8300-9b1536a1fb09
This module is a rough estimation of the composition by including raw materials, energy consumption, infrastructure, and transport efforts. Waste as well as all kind of emissions are not taken into account.
Location: Literature data are used to establish a global valuable dataset.
Technology: estimation of the production efforts for a MnZn ferrite.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature &amp; own estimations 
Extrapolations: see generalComment
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bc643030-bb51-3ff4-8300-9b1536a1fb09.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
